    "name": "Town of Zoz",
    "steam_appid": 1748110,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1748110/extras/2a25daa06973eb39dff0b426af42b3c6.avif?t=1750879250\" /></div></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1748110/extras/bc4f8335d762eb3e711010b48d20559f.poster.avif?t=1750879250\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1748110/extras/bc4f8335d762eb3e711010b48d20559f.webm?t=1750879250\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1748110/extras/bc4f8335d762eb3e711010b48d20559f.mp4?t=1750879250\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">After receiving a letter from his parents, Ito reluctantly returns home to help the family farm and restaurant. As he settles back into family life, Ito realizes that the once peaceful village hides an ancient secret, and the town needs his help to reveal its forbidden past, and the dark cloud that haunts them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1748110/extras/1cd7acd8019cd9d49eaec7d00577b116.avif?t=1750879250\" /></div></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1748110/extras/30e54ac258f5843688e291d0ecf61f4e.poster.avif?t=1750879250\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1748110/extras/30e54ac258f5843688e291d0ecf61f4e.webm?t=1750879250\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1748110/extras/30e54ac258f5843688e291d0ecf61f4e.mp4?t=1750879250\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As you explore the area around Zoz and help the townspeople, take advantage of Ito\u2019s skills with his trusty machete as you slash and dodge through enemies while teaming up with several trusted companions. Each one uses their own unique skills to dispatch enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1748110/extras/cc61ed4868acc8defa093c756a56ef6b.avif?t=1750879250\" /></div></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1748110/extras/82e8784e96d48c70e2d73ab40f35ee08.poster.avif?t=1750879250\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1748110/extras/82e8784e96d48c70e2d73ab40f35ee08.webm?t=1750879250\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1748110/extras/82e8784e96d48c70e2d73ab40f35ee08.mp4?t=1750879250\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Food is the way to people\u2019s hearts in Zoz, and giving townsfolk their favorite meal will increase your bonds and allow you to learn more about them. Or eat the meals yourself to gain powerful stat boosts for your next hunt.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1748110/extras/9201fdcc99c17cfcf971dafed4592c3f.avif?t=1750879250\" /></div></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1748110/extras/f4834fc7128ceb1fbf3057dd9ebe4624.poster.avif?t=1750879250\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1748110/extras/f4834fc7128ceb1fbf3057dd9ebe4624.webm?t=1750879250\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1748110/extras/f4834fc7128ceb1fbf3057dd9ebe4624.mp4?t=1750879250\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Everyone has a story to tell, and it\u2019s up to Ito\u2019s mastering of the soul-infused machete and his magic-infused recipes to help them overcome their personal nightmares. Help legendary town heroes, fashionable shopkeepers, stars of the Boonbola team, leaders of a local magical sect, and speak with a Soulsmith who is able to imbue magic into weapons and tools.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1748110/extras/2a25daa06973eb39dff0b426af42b3c6.avif?t=1750879250\" /></div></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1748110/extras/bc4f8335d762eb3e711010b48d20559f.poster.avif?t=1750879250\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1748110/extras/bc4f8335d762eb3e711010b48d20559f.webm?t=1750879250\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1748110/extras/bc4f8335d762eb3e711010b48d20559f.mp4?t=1750879250\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">After receiving a letter from his parents, Ito reluctantly returns home to help the family farm and restaurant. As he settles back into family life, Ito realizes that the once peaceful village hides an ancient secret, and the town needs his help to reveal its forbidden past, and the dark cloud that haunts them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1748110/extras/1cd7acd8019cd9d49eaec7d00577b116.avif?t=1750879250\" /></div></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1748110/extras/30e54ac258f5843688e291d0ecf61f4e.poster.avif?t=1750879250\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1748110/extras/30e54ac258f5843688e291d0ecf61f4e.webm?t=1750879250\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1748110/extras/30e54ac258f5843688e291d0ecf61f4e.mp4?t=1750879250\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As you explore the area around Zoz and help the townspeople, take advantage of Ito\u2019s skills with his trusty machete as you slash and dodge through enemies while teaming up with several trusted companions. Each one uses their own unique skills to dispatch enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1748110/extras/cc61ed4868acc8defa093c756a56ef6b.avif?t=1750879250\" /></div></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1748110/extras/82e8784e96d48c70e2d73ab40f35ee08.poster.avif?t=1750879250\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1748110/extras/82e8784e96d48c70e2d73ab40f35ee08.webm?t=1750879250\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1748110/extras/82e8784e96d48c70e2d73ab40f35ee08.mp4?t=1750879250\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Food is the way to people\u2019s hearts in Zoz, and giving townsfolk their favorite meal will increase your bonds and allow you to learn more about them. Or eat the meals yourself to gain powerful stat boosts for your next hunt.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1748110/extras/9201fdcc99c17cfcf971dafed4592c3f.avif?t=1750879250\" /></div></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1748110/extras/f4834fc7128ceb1fbf3057dd9ebe4624.poster.avif?t=1750879250\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1748110/extras/f4834fc7128ceb1fbf3057dd9ebe4624.webm?t=1750879250\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1748110/extras/f4834fc7128ceb1fbf3057dd9ebe4624.mp4?t=1750879250\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Everyone has a story to tell, and it\u2019s up to Ito\u2019s mastering of the soul-infused machete and his magic-infused recipes to help them overcome their personal nightmares. Help legendary town heroes, fashionable shopkeepers, stars of the Boonbola team, leaders of a local magical sect, and speak with a Soulsmith who is able to imbue magic into weapons and tools.</p>",
    "short_description": "Fight with flavor! As Ito, a young shaman chef adventurer, you'll hunt critters, gather ingredients, and rebuild bonds by cooking for the townspeople. A shaman chef always aims to lend a helping hand, but the more Ito gets involved, the more he'll learn about the town and its ancient secrets.",
